APP_CONTEXT.PRODUCT:
Realm is a greenfield TypeScript project at ~/src/repos/agent-realm/. It ships in three forms:
(1) an Omp plugin that starts automatically with each Omp session when Realm is configured and reachable (Omp is the primary target);
(2) a standalone TypeScript component with a CLI and a long-running local daemon;
(3) MCP and ACP connection surfaces so other agent hosts can use the same sandbox: Muse Code, Claude Code, Grok Build, Hermes Agent, and others.
